Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:22:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ninput: interaction context gesture recognizer

- AddPointer/RemovePointer, ProcessPointerFrames, BufferPointerPackets/ProcessBufferedPackets feed pointer
  frames to a recognizer that reports tap (and double tap), hold, drag and manipulation (translation,
  scaling, rotation) through the output callback; ProcessInertia steps a decelerating manipulation
- GetState, Reset, Stop; Get/SetInteractionConfiguration; measurement units and UI feedback properties
- inertia, mouse wheel, cross slide and pivot parameters are kept; the prototypes and enums are added to
  interactioncontext.h

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

